// Windows resource script template for embedding the application icon.
//
// CMake will generate a real `.rc` file from this template at configure time.
//
// The placeholder `@SMATCHET_ICO_PATH@` is replaced by the absolute .ico path.
//
// IMPORTANT: We use the numeric ID directly (32512 == IDI_APPLICATION) instead
// of relying on `IDI_APPLICATION` being defined in the RC compiler environment.
32512 ICON "@SMATCHET_ICO_PATH@"

